  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (breaking changes: see README \"Migrating to 2.0\")\n      - Target frameworks: net10.0, net8.0, netstandard2.1, netstandard2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.2+ via netstandard2.0)\n      - Removed EOL targets and Newtonsoft.Json, removed all [Obsolete] members\n      - Pooled HTTP handlers: connections are reused across requests (no more socket exhaustion)\n      - Removed the global ServicePointManager callback that disabled TLS certificate validation for the whole process\n      - Immutable builder: every fluent call returns an independent copy\n      - Smaller API: SendAsync<T>(method) + Get/Post/Put/Patch/Delete/Head/Options; T can be string, byte[], Stream or a DTO\n      - Real streaming for Stream results, streaming JSON deserialization\n      - RestResult<T> moved to the RestClient namespace\n      - Query string: url-encoded, invariant culture, repeated keys\n      - Built-in retry policy, refresh token de-duplicated across concurrent requests\n      - multipart/form-data uploads\n      - Native AOT and trimming friendly JSON (JsonSerializerContext)\n      - ILogger logging and OpenTelemetry tracing (ActivitySource \"Mafe.RestClient\")\n      - Nullable reference types annotations\n      - New package Mafe.RestClient.Extensions.DependencyInjection (IHttpClientFactory integration)\n\n      1.9.5\n      - Target .NET 8.0 (net8.0)\n      - Upgrade all dependences\n\n      1.9.3\n      - Target .NET 7.0 (net7.0)\n      - Upgrade all dependences\n\n      1.9.2\n      - Upgrade all dependences\n\n      1.9.1\n      - Improper Handling of Exceptional Conditions in Newtonsoft.Json #1\n\n      1.9.0\n      - Target .NET 6.0 (net6.0)\n      - Upgrade all dependences\n\n      1.8.1\n      - Removing .Result\n      - Removed unsupported target frameworks\n\n      1.8.0\n      - Target .NET 5.0 (net5.0)\n      - Removed unsupported target frameworks\n\n      1.7.7\n      - managing fluent httpclient\n\n      1.7.6\n      - hotfix catch exeception\n\n      1.7.5\n      - hotfix\n\n      1.7.4\n      - hotfix on parameters.\n\n      1.7.3\n      - json and xml settings during serialization and deserialization of an object.\n\n      1.7.2\n      - Target .NET Core 3.1 (netcoreapp3.1)\n\n      1.7.1\n      - Target .NET Core 3.0 (netcoreapp3.0)\n      - Target .NET Core 2.2 (netcoreapp2.2)\n      - Target .NET Core 2.1 (netcoreapp2.1)\n      - Target .NET Core 2.0 (netcoreapp2.0)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.7    (net47)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.7.1  (net471)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.7.2  (net472)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.8    (net48)\n\n      1.7.0\n      - Optimization and Refactoring HttpClientCompressionHandler\n\n      1.6.0\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.6    (net46)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.6.1  (net461)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.6.2  (net462)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.5    (net45)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.5.1  (net451)\n      - Target .NET Framework 4.5.2  (net452)\n\n      1.5.3\n      - Enabled gzip compression\n      - Refactoring HttpContentStream\n\n      1.5.2\n      - Target .NET Standard 1.3 (netstandatd1.3)\n\n      1.5.1\n      - Target .NET Standard 2.1 (netstandatd2.1)\n      - Target .NET Standard 2.0 (netstandatd2.0)\n\n      1.5.0\n      - Refactoring builder\n      - Parameter bugfix\n      - General bugfix\n\n      1.4.0\n      - Added OnPreCompleted, OnCompleted and OnPreviewContentAsString\n      - Refactoring some methods.\n      - Added BufferSize and check on buffer size value",
